[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0808","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0145","title":"Microsoft Outlook 和 Outlook Express VCard 处理程序缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Outlook 2000/98 及 Outlook Express 5.x 的 VCard 处理程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标用户发送包含恶意生日字段的特制 vCard 文件，当用户使用受影响版本打开该 vCard 时触发缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响范围广泛，利用方式简单，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS01-012 中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0145"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:45Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-012 提供的官方补丁，将 Internet Explorer 升级至 5.01 SP1/SP2 或 5.5 SP1 版本以修复 VCard 处理程序中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，应在邮件客户端中禁用自动预览 vCard 附件功能，并教育用户不要打开来自不可信来源的 .vcf 文件附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a022301-1.txt","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-012","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0145.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0145.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0145.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0145","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2001/CVE-2001-0145.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0145.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0145.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0145.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0145.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c79f038b13e1b688fc233f22ffcfe21236e6044/2001/CVE-2001-0145.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0808.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0660","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0660.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0196","title":"FreeBSD inetd ident server 信息泄露漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 3.x 和 4.x 版本中，inetd 内置的 ident 服务器（RFC1413 协议实现）在运行过程中错误地使用了 root 用户的组权限而非实际连接用户的组权限，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以读取系统中 wheel 组可访问文件的前 16 字节内容。该漏洞影响所有未修复的 FreeBSD 3.x 和 4.x 版本，攻击者只需向目标主机 113 端口发送 ident 协议请求即可触发，无需任何身份验证。成功利用可能导致敏感配置文件或密钥材料的片段泄露，进而辅助后续攻击。FreeBSD 已在 2000 年 11 月和 2001 年 1 月分别发布针对 4.x 和 3.x 版本的补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0196"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:51Z","remediation":"将受影响的 FreeBSD 系统升级至 4.2-STABLE 或更高版本（或 3.5-STABLE 及其后续版本），以获取修复后的 inetd 代码。若暂无法升级，可编辑 /etc/inetd.conf 注释掉所有以 \"auth\" 开头的 ident 服务行，然后执行 killall -HUP inetd 重启 inetd 以禁用 ident 服务器作为临时缓解。也可从 ftp://ftp.FreeBSD.org/pub/FreeBSD/CERT/patches/SA-01:11/ 下载对应版本的 inetd 补丁，在 /usr/src/usr.sbin/inetd 目录下执行 patch -p 后重新编译安装并重启 inetd。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1753","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2324","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6052","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0196.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0196.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0196","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0196.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0196.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1df391c77d130b035c18b078a1d93cfdac5c26df/2001/CVE-2001-0196.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0196.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0196.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0196.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0196.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0660.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0656","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0656.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0186","title":"Free Java Web Server 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Free Java Web Server 1.0 存在目录遍历漏洞，由于服务器未对用户提交的文件路径参数进行有效过滤和验证，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过构造包含 \"..\" (点点) 路径遍历序列的 HTTP 请求，突破 Web 根目录限制，读取服务器文件系统中的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、源代码、系统文件等）。该漏洞影响 Free Java Web Server 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响机密性。攻击者可直接利用该漏洞获取服务器敏感信息，进一步渗透内网或组合其他漏洞实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0186"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:50Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用已停止维护的 Free Java Web Server 1.0，迁移至 Tomcat 或 Jetty 等现代化 Java Web 容器。若无法立即迁移，应在前端部署 WAF 或反向代理，配置 URL 过滤规则拦截所有包含 \".. \" 或 \"%2e%2e\" 的请求路径，以阻断目录遍历攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0061.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0186.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0186.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0186","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0186.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0186.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0186.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/092113bf9ab92144574ec15fc26608ac15913e5a/2001/CVE-2001-0186.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ccbb22644b8f8cd8300036a10ac1ec6d68c2d1a3/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0186.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0186.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/514c5de1bed57e2dcb3d56992a549e0097d9794f/api/2001/CVE-2001-0186.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0656.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0653","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0653.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0179","title":"Allaire JRun 畸形URL目录信息泄露漏洞","description":"Allaire JRun 3.0 存在目录遍历及敏感文件信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含特殊字符\".\"的畸形URL，绕过访问控制机制，列出WEB-INF目录下的文件列表并读取web.xml配置文件内容。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，成功利用后可获取应用程序敏感配置信息，为后续攻击提供辅助。受影响版本为Allaire JRun 3.0，攻击者只需通过网络访问目标JRun服务器即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0179"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:49Z","remediation":"立即将 Allaire JRun 3.0 升级至 3.1 或更高版本以修复漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可在前端部署 URL 过滤规则，拦截包含连续点号（如 \"..\" 或 \"%2e%2e\"）的畸形请求，防止攻击者枚举 WEB-INF 目录内容；同时建议在 web.xml 中配置 <security-constraint> 对 /WEB-INF/* 路径实施访问限制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=19546&Method=Full","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6008","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0179.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0179.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0179","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0179.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0179.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0179.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2001/CVE-2001-0179.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0179.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0179.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0179.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0653.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0649","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0649.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0174","title":"趋势科技 Virus Buster 2001 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Trend Micro Virus Buster 2001 8.00 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含超长\"收件人\"（To）地址的邮件数据包触发该漏洞，导致邮件扫描服务崩溃拒绝服务，并在特定条件下可能执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响运行 Trend Micro Virus Buster 2001 8.00 的 Windows 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可在复杂攻击条件下利用，成功利用将完全危及目标系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0174"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:48Z","remediation":"立即将 Trend Micro Virus Buster 2001 升级至 8.01 版本。注册用户可通过软件内置的 intelligent update 智能更新功能自动下载补丁，需提供有效许可密钥；如使用杂志或 CD-ROM 附带的试用版，请先购买正式许可证并完成用户注册后再执行更新。临时缓解措施：配置邮件客户端或邮件服务器拒绝收包含超长 To 头字段（超过 16,000 字符）的邮件，并在防火墙层面过滤异常长度的邮件头。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0500.html","http://www.osvdb.org/6138","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6034","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4cd39de946c4dae2d75d1f265b016c2f29e5b92a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0174.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0174.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0174","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0174.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0174.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0174.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a3231978c760368f8f6b5637cdf1c49798e2fdc5/2001/CVE-2001-0174.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0174.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0174.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0174.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0649.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0640","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0640.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0152","title":"Microsoft Plus! for Windows 98/Me 压缩文件夹密码泄露漏洞","description":"Windows 98 和 Windows Me 的 Plus! 组件中压缩文件夹功能的密码保护选项存在信息泄露漏洞。该功能在设置密码保护时会将密码信息以明文或可恢复形式写入系统文件，本地攻击者可通过读取该文件获取压缩文件夹的访问密码，从而绕过保护机制访问受保护的压缩文件夹内容。攻击条件要求攻击者具有本地系统访问权限，无需特殊权限即可实施。Microsoft 未针对此漏洞发布官方补丁，建议用户避免在受影响的系统上使用压缩文件夹密码保护功能。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0152"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:46Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-019 提供的补丁，该补丁可阻止密码被写入磁盘。安装后务必手动删除 `C:\\Windows\\dynazip.log` 文件以清除已记录的密码。验证方法：检查 `zipfldr.dll` 版本——Plus! 98 系统应为 5.0.518.20（日文 NEC 版为 5.0.526.20），Windows Me 系统应为 5.50.4213.1600。如无法安装补丁，避免使用压缩文件夹密码保护功能，或改用 Windows 2000 及以上版本系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-019","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0152.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0152.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0152","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0152.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0152.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0152.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81a148a05078ecaf8ff30dafcb6a9851540b3434/2001/CVE-2001-0152.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0152.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/7b0091a6728c321d97febad01bf502be7a113020/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/f785f3444159263c9afde232b5456d1f01686673/api/2001/CVE-2001-0152.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0640.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0245","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0245.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0301","title":"Analog ALIAS命令缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Analog 日志分析工具 4.16 版本之前存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过 ALIAS 命令构造超长字符串触发栈溢出，进而执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证且攻击复杂度低，成功利用可完全控制目标系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。受影响版本需升级至 Analog 4.16 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0301"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:03Z","remediation":"立即升级 Analog 至 4.16 或更高版本。对于 Debian 系统，执行 apt-get update && apt-get upgrade analog 命令安装安全更新 DSA-033；对于其他发行版，从 https://www.analog.cx/ 下载最新版本并编译安装。若无法立即升级，在 Web 服务器配置中禁用 ALIAS 命令作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0264.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/redhat/2001-q1/0056.html","http://www.analog.cx/security2.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-033","http://www.osvdb.org/1762","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2377","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6105","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0301.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0301","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0301.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0301.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-033.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-43xj-jq6q-9wr8/GHSA-43xj-jq6q-9wr8.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a3a861fb-ae66-4f2c-b2ad-6b629f7dbac4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0301.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0245.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0239","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0239.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0191","title":"XEmacs gnuserv 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"标签包裹。<value>gnuserv 3.12 及更早版本（随 XEmacs 发行）在处理 X Windows MIT-MAGIC-COOKIE cookie 时未对指定长度进行正确边界校验，存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-120）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务发送特制的超长 cookie 触发缓冲区溢出，进而执行任意系统命令；也可利用长度校验缺陷进行暴力破解以绕过认证机制。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 gnuserv 版本的 XEmacs 用户，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0191"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:51Z","remediation":"立即将 gnuserv 升级至 3.12 或更高版本。XEmacs 用户应更新 XEmacs 至包含 gnuserv 3.12 及以上的版本，或单独替换 /usr/lib/xemacs/xemacs-packages/gnuserv 目录下的 gnuserv 组件。如暂时无法升级，应在防火墙中阻断 12000/tcp 端口（gnuserv 默认监听端口）的外部访问，并通过 xauth 使用更长的 MIT-MAGIC-COOKIE 以增大暴力破解难度，同时检查并限制 localhost 以外的连接来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0030.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-019.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-010.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-011.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6056","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0191.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b5